(175, 5, 'Level 17', 'GETTING INPUT', 'The Letter Pick', 'The Scanner has no method that reads a char directly. Read the text as a String, then use charAt(index number) to pick one character from it. Index numbers start at 0, so charAt(0) is the first character.

Read a line with scan.nextLine() and store its first character in a char named letter.', 'Chain .charAt(0) after scan.nextLine().', 'char letter = scan.nextLine().charAt(0);', 60, 8, 17, 1, '2026-10-09 08:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 'Use the exact solution: char letter = scan.nextLine().charAt(0);', 'char\\s+letter\\s+=\\s+scan\\.nextLine\\(\\s*\\s*\\)\\.charAt\\(\\s*0\\s*\\);', '/assets/landscapes/oakheart1.png', 'Reading a char', 'The Scanner has no method that reads a char directly. Read the text as a String, then use charAt(index number) to pick one character from it. Index numbers start at 0, so charAt(0) is the first character.

